cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Sauna Heater Size Table"
abstract: >-
  Electric sauna heater power in kW for rooms of 3 to 30 cubic meters, with
  0 to 4 square meters of uninsulated glass or stone and with or without bare
  log walls, computed from Harvia and HUUM published sizing rules. A
  rule-of-thumb reference, not an engineering specification.
authors:
